	* libexec/spamd/spamd.c: - \r\n fix for QUIT command

	  - Implement RSET in spamd - some virus scanning products (notably
	  symantec's viruswall) spew a RSET into the smtp stream before
	  every attempted delivery.  (noticed by reitenba@fh-brandenburg.de
	  and some others). This ensures such things can successfully talk
